<title>USA: Sioux City feeder cattle mostly up $2-$3 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City feeder cattle mostly up $2-$3 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers sold mostly and heifers sold mostly $2-$3 higher Wednesday with overall quality above average. Large attendance of local area farmer/feeders. 65% of supply under 600 lbs, USDA said.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers Medium and Large 1 350-400 lbs 83.00-90.00; 400-450 lbs 82.00-84.00; 450-500 lbs 83.00-86.75; 500-550 lbs 79.50-86.75, thin 87.00-88.50; 550-600 lbs 74.00-76.00, thin 84.50; 600-650 lbs 70.00-72.10, Blkwf 81.25; 650-700 lbs 72.25-75.00, Blk 79.50; 700-750 lbs 69.50-73.00; 750- 800 lbs 70.50; 800-850 lbs 63.50-67.50.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers Medium and Large 1 400-450 lbs 66.00-73.00;</p>
<p>450-500 lbs 69.00-75.00, thin 77.50; 500-550 lbs 68.75-73.50;</p>
<p>550-600 lbs 68.50-71.25; 600-650 lbs 66.00-69.50; 650-700 lbs 64.50-68.25; 700-750 64.75-67.50.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
